Subject: [PATCH 02/15] fix(server): Fix-env config.js side-effect removal and
 F3.60 staff codes security

- server/config.js: Removed `db` import/export to eliminate SQLite side-effects on constants import; consumers updated to import `db` directly from `./server/db/connection.js`.
- server.js, middleware/auth.js, routes/orders.js, services/fcm.js, services/push.js: Updated imports to use direct `db` connection instead of `config.js`.
- server/routes/auth.js: Added 409 Conflict response for admin self-demotion attempts via activation code.
- server.js: Extended `/api/tg/diag` endpoint with `codes_present` boolean flags for env var checks without exposing values.
- tests/staff-stops.spec.js: Added Playwright test suite verifying diag codes presence and admin self-demotion prevention.
- docs/read-if-u-ai.md, PROJECT_RULES.md, docs/ui-checklist.md: Documented staff codes source of truth (.env), rotation procedure, diagnostics, and UI checklist items for role changes.
